          "title": "Угловая скорость",
          "text": "$d\\omega = \\frac{M}{I}dt = \\frac{\\gamma t^2}{I}dt$.\n$\\omega = \\frac{\\gamma t^3}{3I} = \\frac{5 \\cdot 125}{3 \\cdot 0{,}005} = \\frac{625}{0{,}015} \\approx 41667$ рад/с."
        },
        {
          "title": "Работа",
          "text": "$A = \\int_0^5 M \\cdot \\omega\\, dt = \\frac{\\gamma^2}{3I}\\int_0^5 t^5\\, dt = \\frac{\\gamma^2 t^6}{18I}$.\n$A = \\frac{25 \\cdot 15625}{18 \\cdot 0{,}005} \\approx 4{,}34$ МДж.",
          "math": "$$\\boxed{\\omega \\approx 41667 \\text{ рад/с}, \\; A \\approx 4340 \\text{ кДж}}$$"
        }
      ],
      "formula": "\\omega = \\gamma t^3/(3I)"
    },
